<title>USA: Esso Rotterdam plant starts up after power outage.</title>
<headline>Esso Rotterdam plant starts up after power outage.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Esso Netherlands' refinery in Rotterdam is in the process of starting up its units after a power outage in the area on Tuesday, a spokesman for parent Exxon Corp said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The plant, with a capacity to process 175,000 barrels per day, brought all units down after a power outage in the Rotterdam area at 0730 GMT on Tuesday. The outage lasted for 90 minutes, said Exxon spokesman Ed Burwell.</p>
